  "epistemic_type": "project_authority_source_layout_and_visual_fidelity_repair",
  "scope": "Paper02 Unit003 only: restore the five-column continuation schema, terminal upper row, two verified rosette attachment marks, and explicit lower source-note association while preserving the normalized Interslavic body and localized note.",
  "summary": "The Interslavic Paper02 schema now carries the complete ED0014/printed-source geometry instead of the inherited four-column truncation. The standalone producer was reconstructed from the live normalized Unit003 body, not the obsolete historical body.",
  "human_companion": {
    "path": "decision_records/ISV019-EDIT-0133.md",
    "bytes": 4031,
    "sha256": "240A820ED7A427BD096F645A902BFDC645ECD95C887F51739AAA00160469FE67"
  },
  "human_auditable_considerations": {
    "question": "Whether the inherited four-column display was defensible, and whether rebuilding its standalone producer from the historical file would silently undo normalized Interslavic work.",
    "evidence_weighed": [
      "Active ED0014 lines 606-658 contain five columns, the terminal upper row, and two linked source-rosette positions.",
      "The retained printed/GDZ witnesses and exact-5000 crops independently show the same source glyph and attachment logic.",
      "The 6562-byte live pre-edit Unit003 body differs from the 6455-byte historical body; the former is the translation-lineage authority for reconstruction.",
      "The localized Interslavic note already explains the lower attachment and remains byte-exact."
    ],
    "alternatives_rejected": [
      "Retain four columns, because that preserves a material omission rather than a coherent source variant.",
      "Substitute a generic star, because the source uses two matching non-generic rosettes.",
      "Redraw or smooth the glyph, because the accepted source-derived bitmap already has exact custody and placement receipts.",
      "Reconstruct from the historical producer body, because that would regress completed Interslavic normalization.",
      "Mutate frozen v047, public r35, or the online standalone record, because this repair belongs only to v019."
    ],
    "claim_boundary": "Project-authority source-layout fidelity and visual legibility; not native/community validation or critical-edition certification."
  },
